            For most homes with a driveway, siding and a deck, the Simpson MegaShot MS60763 is the machine to buy: a dependable Honda engine and enough flow to make concrete work go quickly. If your list is mostly cars, patios and siding, the Ryobi RY142300 brushless electric is quieter, simpler and needs almost no upkeep. Big flow on a budget points to the Generac SpeedWash, and weekly or paid work justifies the triplex-pump PowerShot.
          </p>
